[00:11.96]1. Jehovah anointed his Son
[00:23.93]To rule over ev’ryone.
[00:35.90]His throne is established on justice,
[00:40.90]That God’s will on earth may be done.
[00:43.40](Chorus)
[00:45.90]Praise Jah for his Son, the Anointed.
[00:50.90]Praise Jesus, O you faithful sheep,
[00:55.89]Who loyally follow day after day
[01:00.88]and all his commandments keep.
[01:05.88]Praise Jah for his Son, the Anointed,
[01:10.88]the Ruler of heavenly fame,
[01:17.95]Anointed with exultation and might
[01:21.95]to honor God’s holy name.
[01:45.12]2. Christ’s brothers are chosen and called.
[01:50.30]God gives them their own new birth.
[01:55.48]This bride class will share in the Kingdom
[02:00.22]And bring Paradise to this earth.
[02:02.67](Chorus)
[02:05.12]Praise Jah for his Son, the Anointed.
[02:10.32]Praise Jesus, O you faithful sheep,
[02:15.84]Who loyally follow day after day
[02:25.48]and all his commandments keep.
[02:46.15]Praise Jah for his Son, the Anointed,
[02:51.84]the Ruler of heavenly fame,
[02:56.84]Anointed with exultation and might
[03:07.44]to honor God’s holy name.